    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダブルボウガン型ソーマ
『ゲイルアーク』か。
これさえあれば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The twin crossbow Soma, Gale Arc, huh? Man, I wish I had that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8380</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;のソーマは双弓型だ
・すごいソーマだね！
・援護を頼むよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;'s twin crossbow Soma
・It's so cool!
・I'm counting on you to watch my back!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダブルボウガン！
すごいソーマだね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, dual wielding crossbows?! That's so cool!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ。これで、てめぇが
逃げ出しても、俺の力で
&lt;Kohaku&gt;を元に戻してやれるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sure is. With this bad boy, I can even fix &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s Spiria myself if you decide to ditch us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、そんな……
オレは逃げたりしないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I... I'd never do that!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>遠距離タイプだね。
&lt;Hisui&gt;、援護を頼むよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's good to have long-range cover. I'm counting on you to watch my back!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん、まかせとけ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh, you got that right.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、てめぇの背中にも
二、三発当たっちまうだろうが
気にすんなよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You MIGHT end up with one or two arrows in the back of your head, but otherwise I'm on it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……かまわないよ。
&lt;Kohaku&gt;のスピルーンを
取り戻すためだからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't care. If it's to get &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s Spirune back, I'll take as many as you want.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お前…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dude...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
